  "Description": "OpenTasks (org.dmfs.tasks). OpenTasks stores tasks in the Android task provider. Remote synchronisation is performed by a separate sync adapter such as DAVx5; OpenTasks itself does not contain sync accounts. The app supports create a task, set the task title and description, set a due date and time, set a start date, set the task priority, set the classification/privacy level, set the task status, set the completion percentage, add a location to a task, add a URL to a task, add a checklist to a task, set an alarm/reminder, create a recurring task, complete a task, edit an existing task, delete a task, browse tasks grouped by due date, browse tasks grouped by start date.",
